"""Unit 6 Practice Exam B — harder, exam-conditions set (L11 + L12).

Same standard as the other B sets: longer cases where two or three details matter, every option a real drug or plan
from the lecture, several options partly true, and earlier-unit principles (CYP, renal dosing) applied to Unit 6 drugs.

Q(topic, objectives, study_guide_items, kind, stem, correct, [(distractor, why_wrong) x4],
  why_correct, takeaway, discriminator, source)
"""


def Q(topic, io, sg, kind, stem, correct, distractors, why, takeaway, disc, src):
    return {"topic": topic, "objectives": io, "sg": sg, "kind": kind, "stem": stem, "correct": correct,
            "distractors": [{"text": t, "why": w} for t, w in distractors], "why_correct": why,
            "takeaway": takeaway, "discriminator": disc, "src": src}


